", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HPKP preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-302 - a=hpkp-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "effb1a309b205566b407b798e50a0466539d0ccc", "parents": ["a32bc86846869e8bcc2efbe7b374ff87d5f0fb97"], "tags": []}], "date": 1506880551, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "7333": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jorg K \u003cjorgk@jorgk.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_52_VERBRANCH", "desc": "merge default to THUNDERBIRD_52_VERBRANCH. a=jorgk DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags", "dom/canvas/test/webgl-mochitest/test_webgl_disjoint_timer_query.html", "dom/media/mediasource/test/test_PlayEventsAutoPlaying.html", "mfbt/WindowsVersion.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null, null], "node": "5fb6af232f119e02f60cbdc6c24f9db2a558ca77", "parents": ["50680c49a5696244a122f6bbc31eb2c016cb02e4", "effb1a309b205566b407b798e50a0466539d0ccc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Masayuki Nakano \u003cmasayuki@d-toybox.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_52_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1367482 NativeKey::HandleCharMessage() should treat a WM_CHAR message for '\\r' as a Enter key press r=m_kato a=jorgk\n\nStarting from 52, NativeKey::HandleCharMessage() ignores all control characters.  However, some keyboard layout utilities may send WM_CHAR message whose wParam is '\\r' for emulating pressing Enter key.  For supporting such utilities, we should dispatch Enter keypress event when HandleCharMessage() receives such event.\n\nNote that this patch does NOT support a pair of WM_KEYDOWN and WM_CHAR whose wParam is '\\r' but the WM_KEYDOWN isn't VK_RETURN.  If there is such case, we need to support it too.  However, it needs a lot of code changes.  So, we shouldn't support it until such bug is filed actually.\n\nMozReview-Commit-ID: CWyvBtLmXgg", "files": ["widget/windows/KeyboardLayout.cpp", "widget/windows/KeyboardLayout.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2edc4420a9b86363601cd7085495103bfa8c7ee4", "parents": ["5fb6af232f119e02f60cbdc6c24f9db2a558ca77"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Daniel Stenberg \u003cdaniel@haxx.se\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_52_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1359624 - Disable nsAuthSambaNTLM module on OSX. r=mayhemer a=jorgk DONTBUILD", "files": ["extensions/auth/nsAuthFactory.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2ddcbc54266bd4f8721a878db354d0a0a4117baf", "parents": ["2edc4420a9b86363601cd7085495103bfa8c7ee4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jorg K \u003cjorgk@jorgk.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_52_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Merge .hgtags file manually to include SM tags. a=jorgk DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cce71d51e710a26393edc59e36f6e72d9ff2c75a", "parents": ["2ddcbc54266bd4f8721a878db354d0a0a4117baf"], "tags": []}], "date": 1506964054, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "mozilla@jorgk.com"}, "7334": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HSTS preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-326 - a=hsts-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.errors", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5afe1e376a0cb52723de1c3b016b8646805afa8c", "parents": ["effb1a309b205566b407b798e50a0466539d0ccc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HPKP preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-326 - a=hpkp-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "00790464cd9c58b08e351189e0f3a29023e605e0", "parents": ["5afe1e376a0cb52723de1c3b016b8646805afa8c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1506966309, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "7335": {"changesets": [{"author": "tbirdbld", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD5240_2017100219_RELBRANCH", "desc": "Automated checkin: version bump for thunderbird 52.4.0 release. DONTBUI